#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:129
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:131
msgid ""
"**Set TTL for finished Jobs:** Use ``ttlSecondsAfterFinished`` to auto-"
"clean completed Jobs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Use resource limits:** Always set CPU and memory limits on Job Pods to "
"prevent resource starvation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Monitor CronJob history:** Review failed Job history regularly; "
"configure ``failedJobsHistoryLimit`` appropriately"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Use restart policies wisely:** ``OnFailure`` retries the container in-"
"place; ``Never`` creates a new Pod on failure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Namespace isolation:** Run batch Jobs in dedicated namespaces to avoid "
"impacting production workloads"
msgstr ""

